            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Tesla, Palantir, Beyond Meat: Trending stocks",
            "description": "<p>One of Tesla's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TSLA\">TSLA</a>) largest shareholders says it will vote against Elon Musk's trillion-dollar pay package. Palantir (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PLTR\">PLTR</a>) shares fall despite earnings beat, and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMD\">AMD</a> is down ahead of its financial results today. Following a rally yesterday, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/IREN\">IREN</a> and other infrastructure companies (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CIFR\">CIFR</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LUMN\">LUMN</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMKR\">AMKR</a>) are deep in the red in pre-market. Beyond Meat (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BYND\">BYND</a>) also nosedives after delaying reporting earnings.</p>\n<p>For more live coverage of the markets, watch the full episode of <em>Market Sunrise</em> and visit<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/\"> Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>",
